      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the\nCouncil of Ministers as shown in Annexure 'A' have\nrelinquished their respective offices with effect from\nthe forenoon of 14th January, 1980."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        153.51,
        285.44,
        524.2,
        285.44,
        524.2,
        351.11,
        153.51,
        351.11
      ],
      "text": "2.\nSmt. Indira Gandhi has been sworn-in as the\nPrime Minister by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other\nMinisters sworn-in by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980 are shown at Annexure 'B'."
    },
